Mazloom-e-Karbala Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
Banu Ke Dilruba Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
<br>
1.Markhad Pa Aakey Madar Aansu Baharahi Hai<br>
Hum Shakle Mustafa Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
<br>
2.Naize Uochal Ke Paani Baichan Horaha Hai<br>
Abbas-e-Bawafa Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
<br>
3.Be Shoor-o-Shain Zainab Faryaad Karrahi Hai<br>
Farzande Mustafa Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
<br>
4.Laaye Kahan Chadar Phoolou Ki Ibne Sarwar<br>
Pyase Shah-e-Huda Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me<br>
<br>
5.Har Ek Dil Hazi Hai Sar Peet Aaye Razi Tu<br>
Aulad-e-Fatima Ka Chehlum Hai Karbala Me
